# Keeps the build context (and so the cache-busting COPY . . layer in
# Dockerfile) to what the Linux binary actually needs. Mirrors .gitignore
# plus the things only relevant to a local, non-container dev loop.
#
# LICENSE and THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md stay: the final stage's
# COPY LICENSE THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md /licenses/ needs both in the context.
.git
.github
.idea
/dist
/flockdeck
/flockdeck.exe
/flockdeck-chat.exe
design
deploy
